---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '@/config';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="How Real Daily Review handles your data.">
  <article class="article-body">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p style="color: var(--color-muted);">Last updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long', day: 'numeric' })}</p>

    <h2>Plain-English summary</h2>
    <p>
      We collect the absolute minimum to run the site: anonymous traffic stats, your email if you
      subscribe, and your message if you send feedback. We don’t sell data. We don’t share data with
      third parties except as needed to run essential services (hosting, email delivery).
    </p>

    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Analytics:</strong> Cloudflare Web Analytics — privacy-respecting, no cookies, no fingerprinting.</li>
      <li><strong>Newsletter:</strong> Email address only, supplied by you to subscribe. Held in our email service provider (Resend) for delivery.</li>
      <li><strong>Feedback form:</strong> The message you send, plus a Turnstile token (anti-spam, no tracking).</li>
      <li><strong>Server logs:</strong> Standard request logs (IP, timestamp, URL) at our CDN, retained 14 days for security.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>What we don’t collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>No third-party trackers beyond what advertising partners (if active) require.</li>
      <li>No fingerprinting cookies set by us.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Advertising</h2>
    <p>
      If we run ads, ad partners (Google AdSense, Ezoic) may set their own cookies subject to their
      privacy policies. EU/UK visitors will see a consent banner before any non-essential cookies
      are set.
    </p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>
      You can unsubscribe from email at any time via the link in every email. To request deletion of
      any data we hold about you, write to <a href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`}>{SITE.contactEmail}</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Privacy questions: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`}>{SITE.contactEmail}</a></p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
